{"3465810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snatch Squad", "steam_appid": 3465810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open, living world with a criminal contract system. Choose your gear and team roles with friends, plan your infiltration methods and escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.poster.avif?t=1786544863\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.webm?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.mp4?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POLICE ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirens, chases, ambushes, and special police units! Experience dynamic co-op gameplay with role division and tactical depth. Face off against different police forces based on the contract’s difficulty, and use every trick to evade pursuit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONEY LAUNDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legal business is a front — a laundromat for dirty money. Take control of districts and unlock new properties. The more assets you own, the more ways you have to legitimize your loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.poster.avif?t=1786544863\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.webm?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.mp4?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of palm trees and neon, inspired by Miami — alive with districts, gangs, random events, and turf wars. The aesthetic of <i>Miami Vice</i> meets the voxel style of <i>Minecraft</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snatch Squad</strong> isn’t just a series of heists — it’s a journey: from hired gun to criminal kingpin in a sun-soaked, neon-drenched city full of danger and temptation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open, living world with a criminal contract system. Choose your gear and team roles with friends, plan your infiltration methods and escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.poster.avif?t=1786544863\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.webm?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/420190348088696199ea36f1ec4750c3.mp4?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POLICE ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirens, chases, ambushes, and special police units! Experience dynamic co-op gameplay with role division and tactical depth. Face off against different police forces based on the contract’s difficulty, and use every trick to evade pursuit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONEY LAUNDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legal business is a front — a laundromat for dirty money. Take control of districts and unlock new properties. The more assets you own, the more ways you have to legitimize your loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.poster.avif?t=1786544863\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.webm?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/extras/97d6dd46080f3f74eac22fb65b453bcb.mp4?t=1786544863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of palm trees and neon, inspired by Miami — alive with districts, gangs, random events, and turf wars. The aesthetic of <i>Miami Vice</i> meets the voxel style of <i>Minecraft</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snatch Squad</strong> isn’t just a series of heists — it’s a journey: from hired gun to criminal kingpin in a sun-soaked, neon-drenched city full of danger and temptation.</p>", "short_description": "Imagine Payday in an open world like GTA — built entirely of blocks. Snatch Squad is a co‑op crime sim in a voxel city. Plan and execute heists, launder money through legit businesses, and outsmart the police.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/58eebf780fef3b41e27d7ad27f05ec5396e54cd3/header.jpg?t=1786544863", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/4730dd0c0cbdf8fefcc21418c83ae33fb95a1d45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786544863", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465810/4730dd0c0cbdf8fefcc21418c83ae33fb95a1d45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786544863", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core-i5 2550K 3.4GHz / AMD FX 8120 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core-i7 3770 3.4GHz / AMD FX-8350 4.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "de